         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/yw484ky7093.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Ink, written along the roll so the crop has to be turned a quarter turn; both panels carry it and both read once turned. Roll number 588, then the three date groups separated by dots. The 4 and the 6 are plain. The year is a plain 1 followed by a crossed 7, the bar across the stem visible under magnification, so 17 and not 11. No name in this crop."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
